actor_profile.cpp). daAlink_c::execute, camera_execute and dMeter2_c::_execute open segments that
the port times on sampled sub frames (one frame in eight, full receipts only) and charges to the
executing process's profile; calls across translation units are timed by link wrappers instead.
Outside sampled frames each segment pays one flag test. No game behaviour changes: same calls, same
order, same results.

